l\n\nCONTROLLER CONTROLS\nL3 - Sprint\nL2/R2 - Struggle to escape\nSquare/X - Roll\n\nInspired by Infectious Smile, Combat Warriors and Da Hood\nCreds to amonguslegend62538 for the icon, logo and the 2nd Thumbnail\n\nServer restart = Update/Bug Fix\n© Lomkat All Rights Reserved","path":"/game/9537016073-learning-with-pibby-glitched-chaos","slug":"9537016073-learning-with-pibby-glitched-chaos","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/81c31e1fce3ed29332c0fe77e6a2247312fad1ba44529639758713e842a64fd6.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-aa40a526a375633f194f029e05c3b8a0/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":21,"visitor":77094765,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-01-28T05:51:34.331Z","creator":{"name":"Lomkat","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":14206055326,"name":"[RELEASE] Rogue Ninja","desc":"🚨50K LIKES FOR NEXT CODE! 🚨\nRECENT CODES: (PRESS THE COINS BUTTON IN GAME)\n\n-HELLOAGAIN\n-NEXTUPDATENEXTYEAR\n\nPremium players earn a coin every minute!\n\nInspired by the show, \"Naruto\".\n\nKeybinds for keyboard and controller users can be found on the bottom right corner of the screen. Press the information button in the top left corner for the combat guide and update log.","path":"/game/14206055326-rogue-ninja","slug":"14206055326-rogue-ninja","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/cc677102dba46fa5c35aef387f290d9073590fc3ec93d97ece511f83c7b6fe3e.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-94af42d0af9dc87e335a8f356f8d8b14/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":21,"visitor":16389833,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-05-09T16:02:27.069Z","creator":{"name":"TS Corporation.","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":6407649031,"name":"No-Scope Arcade [NEW]","desc":"No-Scope Arcade is a fast-paced, adrenaline-pumping, movement-based first-person shooter! Run through the battleground arena to squash the competition and come out as the ultimate winner. Do you have what it takes to be more skilled than your opponents?\n\nUnlock gun skins, character skins, bullet tracers, kill effects, and melee weapons with the tokens you get rewarded. Evade your enemies with jumping, sliding, and wall-hopping movements to avoid being shot.\n\nWant to support the game and team? Awesome!\n👍 Leave a like and favorite\n📨 Follow the game and come back for updates\n🤼 Play with friends!","path":"/game/6407649031-no-scope-arcade","slug":"6407649031-no-scope-arcade","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/c6aeb67a458c2be30ec32ad9da8473cfc5a3df896eac2cb2730c3a3332038f4d.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-f67a7673e035a3f7ab9026062800b606/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":21,"visitor":209912710,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-11-17T00:32:21.014Z","creator":{"name":"Iconic Gaming Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":27,"freeCount":26,"keyCount":5,"verifiedCount":2}},{"id":8916037983,"name":"starving artists (DONATION GAME)","desc":"🎨 Welcome to Starving Artists, a game where you can make or buy art, sell it, and strive to become the most popular artist! Link your clothing to your art for any price, and gain Robux from every sale! When someone buys your art, the painting will be transferred to the buyers in-game inventory to be kept or resold!\n\n🖼️ To create a t-shirt, click HERE! https://www.roblox.com/develop?View=2\n\n⭐ Hey you! Join the group for a very special surprise.. https://www.roblox.com/groups/13751258\n\nWill you become the next artist with the most valuable painting?\n\nNote: Robux can take up to a week to receive!\n\nAll content in game, including any sponsored content, was developed, uploaded and published by the game's development team. ","path":"/game/8916037983-starving-artists","slug":"8916037983-starving-artists","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/3f1954e5bd00910d3ddafa0914865a487f9a0ee40303a8528bbbcbfa842bbca8.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-8cdb2e81fb043652d4ee92bb42286ecd